    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DR. ROBERT'S CLINIC is a puzzle-solving, exploration RPG game. In this game, you will take on the role of a city patrol officer, investigating a series of ongoing disappearances. During one of your investigations, you are attacked by monstrous creatures known as &quot;Insects&quot; and fall into a coma. When you wake up, you find yourself lying on a hospital bed in a clinic, with a familiar face emerging before your eyes\u2014Dr. Claire Robert...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This clinic is filled with secrets, and you will delve deeper into the truth behind the disappearances. As the story unfolds, you will face numerous challenges, whether it be battling eerie monsters or venturing into unknown illusionary spaces to solve various mechanisms and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the investigation, you will gradually uncover the hidden side of the doctor\u2014her past, her inner thoughts, and her emotions. The relationship between you and her will become the key to driving the story forward. Your choices, your trust, or even your suspicions will all influence the ultimate outcome of this story.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DR. ROBERT'S CLINIC is a puzzle-solving, exploration RPG game. In this game, you will take on the role of a city patrol officer, investigating a series of ongoing disappearances. During one of your investigations, you are attacked by monstrous creatures known as &quot;Insects&quot; and fall into a coma. When you wake up, you find yourself lying on a hospital bed in a clinic, with a familiar face emerging before your eyes\u2014Dr. Claire Robert...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This clinic is filled with secrets, and you will delve deeper into the truth behind the disappearances. As the story unfolds, you will face numerous challenges, whether it be battling eerie monsters or venturing into unknown illusionary spaces to solve various mechanisms and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the investigation, you will gradually uncover the hidden side of the doctor\u2014her past, her inner thoughts, and her emotions. The relationship between you and her will become the key to driving the story forward. Your choices, your trust, or even your suspicions will all influence the ultimate outcome of this story.</p>",
